From: XR1710G AP project
Subject: [PATCH] hostapd: explicit opt-in automatic MTK PP command/event and validated CSA

Adapt selected Allen Ye MTK08196fa6 services0092 ABI, not full vendor fork.
Default xr_pp_mode0 preserves generic manual operation; auto1 sends0xcc and
validates event5 nested frequency/bitmap lengths before dispatch. Match only
the opted-in BSS/link and use normal hostapd CSA frequency/bitmap validation.
No default firmware-auto enablement. Reject failed CSA visibly. FW/RF and
multi-BSS/MLD interoperability remain hardware qualifications.

